{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573560/extras/721fa0c6c7cc4d47093a2f99198bacf9.avif?t=1758428577\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573560/extras_big/721fa0c6c7cc4d47093a2f99198bacf9.avif?t=1758428577 width=800 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a frenetic journey through an adrenaline-fueled, where every moment is a whirlwind of flying bullets and split-second decisions. In this Bullet Heaven, rogue-lite on wheels with RPG elements, each new adventure brings unique and thrilling challenges. Explore vast and perilous landscapes, choosing your gear to take on relentless enemies and formidable bosses. Brace yourself for intense action and constant thrill . </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573560/extras/055e88b3101075d70c1b557c4d6093a9.avif?t=1758428577\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573560/extras_big/055e88b3101075d70c1b557c4d6093a9.avif?t=1758428577 width=800 height=96 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>CARS &amp; MULTIPLAYER</strong>: Gear up, speed ahead, smash through, and drift to leave your enemies in the dust!\u00a0Team up with up to 4 heroes to explore, conquer, and dominate together. Forge bonds and take down the toughest foes as a squad!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573560/extras/77c1d3b441b24dc45f4d21c679ab7da9.poster.avif?t=1758428577\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573560/extras/77c1d3b441b24dc45f4d21c679ab7da9.webm?t=1758428577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573560/extras/77c1d3b441b24dc45f4d21c679ab7da9.mp4?t=1758428577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UPGRADES,\u00a0EQUIPMENTS &amp;\u00a0UNLOCKABLES \u00a0</strong>: Boost your power with better gear, legendary equipment, and upgrades that make you unstoppable.\u00a0Discover a vast arsenal of weapons and equipment, each with unique mechanics to master and customize your playstyle!\u00a0Unlock powerful new gear, exclusive buffs, and unique characters as you progress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573560/extras/c765f4085c46bc57b635cde80796989f.poster.avif?t=1758428577\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573560/extras/c765f4085c46bc57b635cde80796989f.webm?t=1758428577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573560/extras/c765f4085c46bc57b635cde80796989f.mp4?t=1758428577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DUNGEONS &amp; QUESTS</strong>: Find hidden dungeons, face waves of enemies, and claim valuable rewards. Stumble upon random quests during your adventure for extra loot and surprises!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573560/extras/97b72184ccf93a1815ec4a010dc65c35.poster.avif?t=1758428577\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573560/extras/97b72184ccf93a181